[11/14 17:44:30     17s] @file 25: # Go through global settings for macros and see if there's a local override
[11/14 17:44:30     17s] @file 26: foreach {blockname blockpath} [array get global_macro_exportdir] {
[11/14 17:44:30     17s] 
